WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Yue Sheng, I remember

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,560
if what you said is right

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:06,120
You can go to Uncle Zhao to get three units of food.

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:08,940
Thank you Captain Shen

5
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,100
What does he mean? Can you understand me?

6
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,870
I also think a good undergraduate degree is no worse than a junior college degree.

7
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:47,450
Will they make it out alive? You're right.

8
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:48,650
The sun goes out for one minute

9
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:49,730
It really has no impact

10
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:53,530
Thank you for saving us. No need to thank me.
